van features 20+ lifestyle amenities including a 5-level podium parking, modern fitness center, indoor games room, landscaped green zones, jogging track, kids’ play area, open-air amphitheater, lounge, and banquet hall, providing a holistic living experience. Close to key landmarks, Vrindavan ensures convenience with nearby spiritual sites like Jain Mandir and Haveli, reputed educational institutions such as Nutan and Saraf College, prominent healthcare centers including Lifeline and Sun Hospital, and popular shopping malls like Dmart, Infinity Mall, and Inorbit Mall. Business hubs like Natraj Market are just 5 minutes away.\n\n₹\n\n## Price vs Locality\n\n/sqft · locality avg **₹40,000**\n\n32% below avg\n\n₹\n\n## Malad West — resale, rent & yield\n\nResale\n\n₹27,000/sqft\n\nmedian · 55 listings\n\nRent\n\n₹78.1/sqft/mo\n\n2 BHK ~₹65,000/mo\n\nGross yield\n\n3.5%/yr\n\nrent vs resale value\n\nThis project is quoted around **₹27,000/sqft** — **in line with** resale here.\n\nFrom MPE live listings, last 18 months · [Mumbai price index ›](/mumbai-property-price-index)\n\n01\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\nProposed\n\nDec 2028\n\nStatus\n\nNew\n\n03\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\nMahaRERA No.\n\nPM1180002500621\n\nRegistered\n\n2025-08-21\n\nLitigation\n\nNo reported in source\n\nEscrow Bank\n\nYES BANK\n\nArchitect\n\n—\n\nTotal FSI\n\n4149\n\n05\n\n## Land DNA · Genesis\n\n**Redevelopment / SRA / MHADA / MMRDA / Freehold** — provenance from MPE's verification layer. The genesis no portal shows.\n\n06\n\n## Location\n\n📍 Borivali  \n19.068486332988034,72.87770000000002\n\n▸ Explore map & Street View — for verified buyers\n\n08\n\n## Availability & Pricing\n\nTypeCarpetPriceAvail\n\n2 BHK685 ft²₹1.85 Cr—\n\n3 BHK905 ft²₹2.44 Cr—\n\n09\n\n## Construction Progress\n\n14% avg\n\nExcavation100%\n\nBasement (if any)50%\n\nExternal plumbing and external plaster, elevation, completion of terraces with waterproofing of the Building / wing.0%\n\nInstallation of Lifts, water pumps, F