025\n\nLaunch Date\n:   July 2018\n\nTotal Area\n:   1 Acres\n\nUnit Sizes\n:   572 - 1130 sq.ft.\n\n## About the Project\n\nVrindavan is a 10-story edifice offering 2 BHK flats and 4 BHK Jodi residences with an easy commute and incredible amenities. Located in the vicinity of Borivali West, Vrindavan is a truly magical space to experience a fresh breath of serenity.\n\n## Amenities\n\nAthletic Turf\n\nKid's Play Area\n\nSustainable Features\n\n## Vrindavan Floor Plans & Layout\n\n## Properties in Vrindavan\n\nNo inventory listed for this project\n\nAs soon as owners and agents list homes in this complex, they'll appear here.\n\n## Locality & Connectivity\n\neducation\n\n2nearby\n\n* DON BOSCO HIGH SCHOOL\n\n  Nearby\n* SCHOOLS & COLLEGES\n\n  Just 3 Mins Away\n\nleisure\n\n1nearby\n\n* GARDENS\n\n  Just 5 Mins Away\n\ntransit\n\n1nearby\n\n* STATION\n\n  Just 5 Mins Away\n\nutility\n\n2nearby\n\n* FIRE STATION\n\n  Nearby\n* HOSPITAL\n\n  Just 4 Mins Away\n\n## Top Agents for Vrindavan\n\n[![Pro icon](/assets/svg/pro-icon.svg)Add me to this project](/dashboard/top-agent)\n\nNo top agents listed yet for this project.\n\nBe the first one to get featured as a top agent.\n\n## About the Developer\n\nCreative Construction\n\nDeveloper / Promoter\n\n### Project Overview\n\nPrice per Sq.ft.\n:   ₹ 30438 - ₹ 35817.31\n\nPossession\n:   January 2025\n\nLaunch Date\n:   July 2018\n\nTotal Area\n:   1 Acres\n\nUnit Sizes\n:   572 - 1130 sq.ft.\n\nVerified Deals. Expert Brokers. Zero Guesswork.\n\nAI-powered matching meets India's most trusted broker network. Buy or sell property with complete confidence.\n\n* ![](/assets/svg/bullet.svg)Buy or Sell with Confidence\n* ![](/assets/svg/bullet.svg)Instant Match, Faster Deals\n* ![](/assets/svg/bullet.svg)India's Largest Verified Network\n\n![Trust Banner Icon](/assets/svg/verified-properties-graphic.svg)\n\n## Your Dream Property Starts Here\n\nFill out the form and let PropHunt.ai match you with the perfect commercial or resident