arkar Udyan and Raghuleela Mega Mall, catering to all daily needs.\n\nWhat are the real estate investment opportunities in Shimpoli, Borivali West?\n\nShimpoli, being part of Borivali West, offers diverse real estate options, primarily residential apartments. The area attracts homebuyers and investors due to its robust social infrastructure, connectivity, and ongoing development. Properties range from 1 BHK to luxurious 4 BHK units and duplexes, catering to various budget and lifestyle preferences.\n\nAre there any new residential projects in and around Shimpoli?\n\nYes, several notable projects are coming up or recently completed near Shimpoli. These include Kalpataru Advay by Kalpataru and Phoenix by H.RISHABRAJ in Borivali West, offering premium 3 and 4 BHK apartments with modern amenities. Other projects like Supreme Imperial by Supreme Real Estate Developer also contribute to the vibrant real estate landscape, providing diverse housing choices.\n\nWhat makes Shimpoli an attractive place to live for families?\n\nShimpoli is highly attractive for families due to its peaceful residential environment combined with excellent urban amenities. Proximity to quality schools, hospitals, parks, and shopping centers like Raghuleela Mega Mall ensures a convenient and comfortable lifestyle. The area's good connectivity further adds to its appeal for daily commutes and family outings.\n\nWhat are the key highlights of living in Shimpoli, Borivali West?\n\nLiving in Shimpoli offers a blend of tranquility and urban convenience. Key highlights include its green spaces, access to top-tier educational and healthcare facilities, strong public transport links including metro and railway, and a wide range of shopping and entertainment options, making it a well-rounded residential choice in Mumbai for a balanced lifestyle.\n\n## Explore Projects in Popular Locations near Vrindavan\n\n### Education\n\n* St Lawrence High School Kandivali1.7 km\n* Ryan International School Kandivali1.8 k